{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980310/extras/77e93a4b33561f36f84b16709743b77d.avif?t=1769591021\" width=383 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a platformer game with a classic mode where you go through all the levels from 1-36.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play 6 different worlds with 6 different levels on each world.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect power-ups that empower the character with abilities like fireball, frostball, super cloud spawn or why not take a swing with the bouncy rope?</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980310/extras/c805288437722d0e9b909f183a8c3b20.avif?t=1769591021\" width=609 height=222 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980310/extras/8bb004cca6465f4ea196a263fb95a9a0.avif?t=1769591021\" width=609 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play with your local co-op friend!\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This feature a local mode with 2 player that can be chosen at start.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shared Life, XP and Items.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980310/extras/ed5d823d8789847551aa3ba8f32ab65c.poster.avif?t=1769591021\" width=608 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980310/extras/ed5d823d8789847551aa3ba8f32ab65c.webm?t=1769591021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980310/extras/ed5d823d8789847551aa3ba8f32ab65c.mp4?t=1769591021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980310/extras/b342b0f4064955ffb9012d23ca05feb3.avif?t=1769591021\" width=609 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect and save power-ups as items</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Co-op you can both access the power-ups items.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player 1 and Player 2 can collect to the inventory. in a shared inventory[/h3</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use the items at the start on a level or when you met an obstacle mid-level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980310/extras/7d82af8ee63ccbd7338e15c77207e2e6.poster.avif?t=1769591021\" width=608 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980310/extras/7d82af8ee63ccbd7338e15c77207e2e6.webm?t=1769591021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980310/extras/7d82af8ee63ccbd7338e15c77207e2e6.mp4?t=1769591021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980310/extras/c7d5510e500ab1ffae16f56db9073e67.avif?t=1769591021\" width=609 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_